+/*********************************************************************************
+ * @file		PAMParkingNavigate.h
+ * @brief		PAMParkingNavigate belongs to ncs_4layer
+ * @details		PAMParkingNavigate belongs to ncs_4layer
+ * @author		Changxuhui
+ * @date		2022/2/21 
